 804:Src/app_cam.c ****    CALLBACK-BATCH MODE (CAPTURE_MODE = 4)
 805:Src/app_cam.c ****    Callback-driven continuous batch capture — NO Stop/Restart between frames.
 806:Src/app_cam.c **** 
 807:Src/app_cam.c ****    Uses g_frame_event_count (incremented by DCMIPP frame event ISR callback)
