 931:Src/app_cam.c ****      Step 4 + 5 unified: walk through warmup AND capture frames in one
 932:Src/app_cam.c ****      loop so the "arm 2 frames ahead" bookkeeping is simple/uniform.
 933:Src/app_cam.c ****      k in [0, CALLBACK_WARMUP_FRAMES) are discarded; k in
 934:Src/app_cam.c ****      [CALLBACK_WARMUP_FRAMES, CALLBACK_WARMUP_FRAMES+CALLBACK_FRAMES) are
 935:Src/app_cam.c ****      the frames we keep (out_idx = k - CALLBACK_WARMUP_FRAMES).
 936:Src/app_cam.c ****      --------------------------------------------------------------- */
